<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94337" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῑταρχ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>commissariat, victualling
				department,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				5(2).266.36
			</span></i> (Mantinea, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.64
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>a soldier's pay in money</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				1350a36
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αρκία</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				1351b16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1353b2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				92(1).3
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				38
			</span></i> (Thermum, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>); opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτομετ ρία</span> (pay in kind), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHal.</u>
				1.159
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PAmh.</u>
				2.29.22
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				729.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				16.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>pay in kind, provisions</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				101.51
			</span></i> (pl.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ σύμβολα τῶν ς.,
				ἐξαρτίσας αὐτὸν ταῖς ς</span>., <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1755.5
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1749.15
			</span></i> (both <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> generally, <i>provision, maintenance</i>,
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				948.14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv/v A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀναγκαία τροφὴ
				ἤτοι ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				5.1708.118
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>.</div>
